sequenceDiagram
  participant U as UI
  participant T as Tauri IPC
  participant C as Core dispatch
  participant W as WebManager
  participant H as ols-helper
  participant S as Server binary
  U->>T: run_command AddDomain
  T->>C: dispatch AddDomain
  C->>W: validate + store domain
  W->>H: hosts-apply 127.0.0.1=app.test
  H-->>W: ok
  U->>T: run_command ApplyWeb
  T->>C: dispatch ApplyWeb
  C->>W: render + validate + backup + reload
  W->>S: nginx -t / reload
  S-->>W: ok
  W-->>U: ApplyReport via CoreResponse
  U->>T: run_command HealthCheck
  T->>C: dispatch HealthCheck
  C-->>U: DNS TCP TLS HTTP steps
